; ── ForwardSmash — TIPPER ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; Ultimate Marth FSmash: startup f10, FAF 52. Signature kill move.
;
; TIPPER (sword tip) — THE kill confirm. High BKB + KBG kills ~100% mid-stage.
;   BKB=36, KBG=80: the reward for spacing out the opponent to max range.
;
; SOURSPOT (sword base) — combo tool below 80%. Won't kill until ~150%.
;   BKB=22, KBG=75: low enough to combo into at mid-screen.
;
; Scene setup: ForwardSmashTipper at sword tip, ForwardSmashBase along sword body.
